Full rules: @docs/CONVENTIONS.md

- One base API in `shared/api/baseApi.ts`; features inject endpoints with `baseApi.injectEndpoints`.
- All tag types declared in `baseApi.tagTypes`. Add a new tag there first, then use it.
- Queries declare `providesTags`, mutations declare `invalidatesTags`. Same tag type on both sides.
- Redux state must be serializable — no `Date`, `Map`, class instances. Use ISO strings.
- Optimistic updates: `onQueryStarted` with `updateQueryData`, rollback via `patch.undo()` in the catch. See @.claude/skills/zod-form-pattern.md.
- Redux-persist: whitelist `cart` only. Never persist `api` slice or `notifications`.
- Selectors live in `model/selectors.ts`; use `useAppSelector` from `shared/store/hooks.ts`, never the raw `useSelector`.
